        {
          "id": "eventbridge-primer-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "Amazon EventBridge is a managed event routing service. An event is a record that something happened, like an order being placed. Use EventBridge when other parts of your application need to react without the order app calling each one itself.",
          "text_sha256": "6b9f1de65e7af90037ad02787d21d2d0bb028e668bdaccd6817b6b18f126a116",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "6b9f1de65e7af90037ad02787d21d2d0bb028e668bdaccd6817b6b18f126a116",
          "asset_sha256": "caf36c23f53d4b4ee5e5c8b9984281c00782ff97dbda00c948aaf3d41d4cce62"
        },
        {
          "id": "eventbridge-primer-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "In this rule-based example, the event bus receives events. A rule matches the fields you care about. A target is where EventBridge sends the matching event.",
          "text_sha256": "ccb26dc8c8d14f295675d006ea3f625444cdba98094195cb461f62f2f6f0a5eb",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "ccb26dc8c8d14f295675d006ea3f625444cdba98094195cb461f62f2f6f0a5eb",
          "asset_sha256": "caf36c23f53d4b4ee5e5c8b9984281c00782ff97dbda00c948aaf3d41d4cce62"
        },
        {
          "id": "eventbridge-primer-03",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "The order app publishes an order-created event to the bus. The rule matches that event type and sends it to an Amazon S Q S queue. The queue holds the work until the fulfillment service is ready to pick it up.",
          "text_sha256": "0bb431ad2cbde8d660e2223ebad527a0e7ee41ae59990e9de0362a7b48f3c7d2",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "7a6172b7217018effe4033da0521f51125cf93cd0f731b3b097dfeec635d131b",
          "asset_sha256": "caf36c23f53d4b4ee5e5c8b9984281c00782ff97dbda00c948aaf3d41d4cce62"
        },
        {
          "id": "eventbridge-primer-04",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "The key distinction: EventBridge routes the event. It does not run the fulfillment steps or track their progress.",
          "text_sha256": "6d01c201059125ab9b05d7af01adbf51f02823bd21e1a788aa8373f3fc51b186",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "6d01c201059125ab9b05d7af01adbf51f02823bd21e1a788aa8373f3fc51b186",
          "asset_sha256": "caf36c23f53d4b4ee5e5c8b9984281c00782ff97dbda00c948aaf3d41d4cce62"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
